<p>Man… I hate being on the fence.</p>
<p>That second interview bit made me happy, what with the lifeboat sinking and seconds later the ghosts from it being assholes. Good stuff.</p>
<p>The incan death god stuff not so much. It's all a bit silly, really.</p>
